anbernic-rg353x-audio-utils (1.1.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Rename package from anbernic-rg353x-headphone-detect to anbernic-rg353x-audio-utils.
  * Add PipeWire and WirePlumber drop-in configurations:
    - Prioritize RK817 internal audio over HDMI.
    - Digital attenuation of -6 dB to prevent RK817 high-pass filter overflow.
    - ALSA buffer headroom tuning.
  * Enhance headphone-jack-detect daemon:
    - Save and restore separate speaker and headphone volume levels across switches.
    - Provide headphone volume safety limiting to protect hearing and reduce noise floor.
  * Update packaging and upgrade migration paths.

